---
import Legal from "../layouts/Legal.astro";
---

<Legal
  title="Billing and subscriptions"
  description="How AgentOS subscriptions, payments, renewals, and cancellations work."
  path="/billing"
  updated="Final professional legal review is required before unrestricted public launch."
>
  <h2>Subscriptions</h2>
  <p>
    Launch prices are Solo $94/month, Pro $169/month, Team $512/month, and
    Brokerage $1,102/month. Major professional features are available across
    paid plans; usage credits, automation volume, seats and other limits vary.
    See <a href="/pricing">Pricing</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Payment handling</h2>
  <p>
    Payment credentials are processed by the configured payment provider.
    AgentOS does not store full card numbers. Professional access activates only
    after a verified server-side payment or subscription webhook confirms the
    subscription; a browser redirect alone does not activate access.
  </p>

  <h2>Renewal, cancellation and refunds</h2>
  <p>
    Subscription status is synchronized from verified provider events. Final
    renewal timing, cancellation, refund, chargeback, tax and credit terms
    remain subject to provider rules, applicable law and final legal review.
    See the <a href="/refunds">Refund Policy</a>.
  </p>

  <p>Billing questions: <a href="/support">AgentOS Support</a>.</p>
</Legal>
